        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. An employee who has left the plant after his or her regular workday and is called back for an emergency or special work assignment, of short duration, less than four (4) hours, shall receive a minimum of four (4) hours work or four (4) hours pay. In computing such pay, hours not worked shall be considered as straight time hours, and hours worked shall be considered as straight time or overtime hours, whichever is applicable under the provisions of Section E of this Article.",
